#90003
"A Large Cave"
"The western wall is solid rock, with only a small plaque in the corner

interupts the uniformity.  Draped across most of the ceiling is a large banner

of the Bog Brigade.  There is a large fountain gurgling here, providing fresh

water.  There is a large statue of a troll wielding a gigantic sword looms

over the fountain.  There are tunnels leading in all directions, oil lamps set

in ornate stands, illuminating the hall, adorn the room.

"
""
