#90006
"Sleeping Chamber"
"This is the sleeping chamber for a small army.  There are maps hanging on

every wall, even one draped across the ceiling, each one of a large piece of

realm.  The room has straw bedding covering the entire floor of the chamber. 

In niches along the south wall of the room are busts of the gods Kerog and

Ulthi, along with a small water trough.  Ornate lampstands built into the wall

provide light to the area.  Pointing northward from the southern wall is a

long obsidian lever.

"
"[Olah] action leads to arena room #90014

